{"id":15561786880,"name":"QUICKDRAW: LEGACY","desc":"READ THE DESCRIPTION BEFORE PLAYING.\n\nBullet comes out of the barrel, there's no fixed reticle (like a crosshair). You can shoot through walls, depends on the material & thickness. Movement sways the arms & torso, causing the \"fire spread\" (there's NO RANDOM spread).\n\nScroll (UP/DOWN) or 1/2 - pick items from inventory\nQ (PRESS) - equip/unequip Q (HOLD) - quickdraw state\nQ + LMB (HOLD) - quickdraw\nLMB (GUN EQUIPPED) (HOLD) - fire\nRMB (GUN EQUIPPED) (HOLD) - focus\nR (GUN EQUIPPED) (IN QUICKDRAW STATE) - switch to regular mode\nR (GUN EQUIPPED) (PRESS/HOLD) - single/full reload\nLEFT SHIFT (HOLD) - slow walk\nLEFT CONTROL (HOLD) - crouch\nRETURN - Popup on bottom left on death to go back to main menu.\n\nLMB/RMB = R2/L2\nScroll = DPAD\nQ = ButtonA\nR = ButtonY\nZ = ButtonX\nLeft Shift = ButtonL1\nLeft Control = ButtonR1\n\nMobile support exists, and you can rebind/change your layout in settings.","path":"/game/15561786880-quickdraw-legacy","slug":"15561786880-quickdraw-legacy","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/938a9023ffb0820e8025d4090f877a10477015f498bb5ddb546536366adb424b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8388f0bd16c992d04566833c032e6533/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":238,"visitor":9838438,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-11T22:25:41.296Z","creator":{"name":"immersion brigade","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a7ba1651bc1014ae441840a","title":"Crosshair I AnnoScripts","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c782d4","gameId":15561786880,"name":"QUICKDRAW: LEGACY","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/938a9023ffb0820e8025d4090f877a10477015f498bb5ddb546536366adb424b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8388f0bd16c992d04566833c032e6533/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"15561786880-quickdraw-legacy","path":"/game/15561786880-quickdraw-legacy","thumbnail":{"url":"ht